Brainstorming and Ideation

Project Title

Auto Ticket Classification System

Problem Statement

Support teams receive a large number of tickets from users every day. Manually reading and categorizing each ticket takes time and may result in incorrect classification. An automated solution is required to classify support tickets into appropriate categories.

Project Idea

The project aims to develop an automated system that analyzes support ticket descriptions and classifies them into appropriate categories.

Objective

- To automate the ticket classification process.
- To reduce manual effort.
- To save time in ticket processing.
- To improve ticket organization.
- To help support teams handle tickets efficiently.

Expected Outcome

An automated system that analyzes support tickets and assigns them to the appropriate category.
